Package: wastewateR
Title: Package for Processing and Analyzing Wastewater-based Epidemiological Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("jules", "", , "juliegil@umich.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c())
Description: This package contains a mixture of functions for use in processing and analyzing wastewater-based epidemiological data. Both main/wrapper functions and minor functions have been included, in order to optimize the flexibility of this package and accommodate multiple laboratory methods. This package is growing and evolving consistently, so please reach out if there are more features you'd like to see.
